        <mxCell id="roadmap_done" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#22C55E;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=15;spacing=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;已完成：PhaseA-D + PhaseE + PhaseF1-F10 + PhaseG1-G31&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• MCP handlers、runtime、tool registry 分层&lt;br&gt;• SessionGraphService / RelationExtractor 边界抽取&lt;br&gt;• MCP + HTTP lifecycle path / error contract hardening&lt;br&gt;• typed units 会议/代码覆盖&lt;br&gt;• docx / yaml 进入 distill、LLMWiki、GraphRAG&lt;br&gt;• 控制台治理化、MCP Debugger response/error 预览、Source Trace fallback、社区图可见性、GraphRAG polish、Explore 规则网格与前端验收&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG1 接口矩阵、迁移护栏与 contract drift 测试&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG2 query MCP / HTTP / CLI shared contract shim&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG3 distill HTTP / CLI shared contract shim&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG4 Source Trace target contract 与 drift tests&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG5 Source Trace shared contract helper&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG6 Source Trace schema 示例与迁移窗口&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG7 Low Signal Audit shared contract helper&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG8 Quality Summary / Correction Plan contract drift tests&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG9 Quality Feedback / Rules / Review contract drift tests&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG10 Quality HTTP shared helper 迁移&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG11 Correction Plan HTTP helper 迁移&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG12 Quality CLI planned 迁移窗口&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG13 Quality CLI 只读 preview&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG14 Quality CLI 写入型治理命令&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG15 knowledge quality entrypoint-ready alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG16 packaging console scripts&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG17 knowledge alias surface guard&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG18 knowledge query alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG19 knowledge workspace read-only alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG20 knowledge source read-only alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG21 knowledge build status alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG22 knowledge graph snapshot alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG23 knowledge trace source alias&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG24 graph advanced CLI migration window&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG25 workspace create/archive CLI aliases&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG26 source import/remove CLI aliases&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG27 build start/cancel CLI aliases&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG28 MCP distill preview&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG29 MCP source trace&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG30 target HTTP query/distill/source trace&lt;br&gt;• PhaseG31 V1.5 closure acceptance accepted" vertex="1">
